[{"title":"归朝欢 叙南李将军园海棠","author":"杨慎","text":"鶗鴂声中春已尽。\n蜀国海棠犹有韵。\n已将淡粉换龙涎，渐看绣缬成香晕。\n脸霞红半隐。\n紫锦经雨胭脂润。\n正清欢，云歌柳舞，聊解朱炎愠。\n十二金钗花作阵。\n不怕周郎回顾问。\n薛涛临镜意先慵，黄荃渲笔愁难近。\n绿樽倾翠酝。\n青蘋风起波文粼。\n望高城不见，遥寄香霏阁信。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 芝山以其慧中所提团扇赠行，侑以蜀锦一幅，词以寄谢","author":"杨慎","text":"李愿本诗仙。\n列屋争妍。\n肯分团扇翠帷边。\n想见清香凝燕寝，秋水明蠲。\n丝繂系兰船。\n回首江天。\n浣花春水腻鱼笺。\n何以报之青玉案，锦字遥传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"杨慎","text":"天地侧身，风尘回首，何年梦落南荒。\n家山千里，烟月记微茫。\n萍水蓬风无定，随处倘佯。\n葛藤话、浮生半日，且卧老僧房。\n门前来往路，叹迷踪羁旅，混迹渔商。\n看海波渺渺，曲似回肠。\n玉关外、多愁易老，算不如沉醉为乡。\n旗亭下，千金斗酒，一掷买春芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"杨慎","text":"首夏偏宜淡薄妆。\n铜青衫子紫香囊。\n清歌一曲送霞觞。\n罗袜凌波回洛浦，淡云轻雨拂高唐。\n纱厨今夜贺新凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"红尘鞍马红亭路，天涯一望无穷。\n长安日下楚云东。\n鸣鞭杨柳陌，分袂杏花丛。\n离拍易终人易散，佳人玉箸啼红。\n今宵明月与君同。\n愁心闻唳鹤，倦寝听归鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"池北池南新绿，树头树底残红。\n多情休怨雨和风。\n东君元是客，归去自匆匆。\n怅望鸳鸯别浦，萧条翡翠芳丛。\n梦回香冷酒微中。\n杜鹍声不断，帘外月朦胧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"宝树林中碧玉凉。\n西风又送木犀黄。\n开成金粟枝枝重，插上乌云朵朵香。\n依绣阁，傍银塘。\n广寒宫里白云乡。\n迥砧横笛声初断，坠露流风夜正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"曲阁飘萧一夜风。\n名花零落五铢红。\n卜欢有信占今夕，买赋多情出后宫。\n朝暮朵，浅深丛。\n翠帏丝障锦帘栊。\n汉江游女愁多露，春在昭阳日影中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其一 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"玉笛送残梅。\n片片随风入镜台。\n台下新妆传玩处，徘徊。\n腊尾春头恨几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其二 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"丝雨湿香街。\n禁住花灯不放开。\n闷上紫姑香火会，遥猜。\n红豆音书甚日来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其三 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"官柳动新枝。\n万缕黄金万缕丝。\n折赠行人千里去，回期。\n莫待清霜落叶时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其四 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"细雨妒芳姿。\n禁住莺翁与燕儿。\n待得晴明好天气，迟迟。\n花絮飞残水满池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其五 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"芳草被金堤。\n野烧红余绿正齐。\n恰翠踏青新雨后，萋萋。\n裙拂秋千彩架底。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 其六 荆州元夕","author":"杨慎","text":"枉渚与回蹊。\n楚雾秦烟望转迷。\n相伴王孙千里去，东西。\n蝴蝶成团杜宇啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"双燕。\n双燕。\n金屋往来长见。\n珠帘半卷风斜。\n何处衔来落花。\n花落。\n花落。\n日莫长门寂寞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"黄鸟。\n黄鸟。\n飞过花枝袅袅。\n绿阴青子初新。\n流水斜阳晚春。\n春晚。\n春晚。\n望断东城上苑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"促织。\n促织。\n声近银床转急。\n熏残百合衣香。\n消尽兰膏夜长。\n长夜。\n长夜。\n露冷芙蓉花谢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"青鸟。\n青鸟。\n来自十洲三岛。\n树头梅蕊春催。\n枕上残妆梦回。\n回梦。\n回梦。\n城角晓闻三弄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔家傲 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"水日闲亭谁与共。\n吸残寒露冰壶冻。\n倒影云峰潭影空。\n湘箔动。\n荼蘼架底清香送。\n篆缕熏残衣雾重。\n黄梅润透红绡缝。\n枕上醒回池上梦。\n开雪洞。\n瑶琴一曲江南弄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔家傲 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"水晶帘外炎歒永。\n纱厨斗帐神仙洞。\n酪粉蔗浆分碧瓮。\n琼斝奉。\n玲珑弦上传啰唝。\n歌罢酒阑行雨送。\n银盆沐水煎金凤。\n懒髻䰒松云乱拥。\n凉意动。\n暗惊团扇生秋梦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"江国梅花千万朵，白云乡里温柔。\n笛声几度怨梁州。\n梦中云满树，醒后月当楼。\n正是相思春信早，桑禽啼破香愁。\n一枝难寄陇西头。\n燕姬钗上见，应是更风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"玉水堤旁千树柳，仙宫还在人天。\n是谁驴背耸诗肩。\n不如来饮酒，倾倒醉吟边。\n鸟踏画檐时点缀，珠帘向晚风穿。\n依稀竹上尽婵娟。\n黄昏图画出，云尽月重圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"梅蕊好，冰玉出烟尘。\n袅袅孤芳尘外色，盈盈一朵掌中春。\n只少似花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"明月好，流影浸亭台。\n金界三千随望远，雕阑十二逐人来。\n只是欠传杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"晴雪好，万瓦玉鳞浮。\n照夜不随青女去，羞明应为素娥留。\n只欠剡溪舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清平乐 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"灯红酒绿。\n山掩围屏曲。\n何处萧萧风动竹。\n好梦惊回难续。\n月华冷浸霜华。\n寒林惊起寒鸦。\n道是天明尚早，小窗横影花花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清平乐 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"金炉尘满。\n绣被熏香懒。\n此恨破除须酒盏。\n争奈愁深酒浅。\n多时弦断瑶琴。\n空余孤凤悲吟。\n谩道鸾胶能续，续来不是前音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷叶杯 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"枕上一声鸡唱。\n天亮。\n好梦忽惊残。\n锦帐香消翠被单。\n寒么寒。\n寒么寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷叶杯 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"远寄音书一纸。\n千里。\n一字一徘徊。\n泪眼愁眉不忍开。\n来么来。\n来么来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"玉貌合教金屋贮。\n天上仙姿，谪在人间住。\n九霞山下曾相遇。\n瓠犀笑破樱桃注。\n别来青鸟如何处。\n岂有仙踪，好寄相思句。\n海月团团生碧树。\n梦随惊鹊南飞去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"好梦难成云易散。\n玳瑁筵前，当日亲曾见。\n金杯满捧香醪劝。\n朱唇半吐樱桃绽。\n别后佳期天样远。\n夜夜相思，寸寸柔肠断。\n徙倚画楼千万遍。\n落梅庭院飘银霰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"灵鹊噪重檐。\n几度虚占。\n锦江春水隔鹣鹣。\n怕见雕梁双燕子，常下珠帘。\n离恨恼江淹。\n彩笔慵拈。\n碧云离合暮山尖。\n伴我归心和别梦，只有银蟾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"去燕又来鸿。\n节序匆匆。\n秋声半夜搅梧桐。\n惊起南窗千里梦，满地西风。\n欹枕听寒蛩。\n离思无穷。\n归期又误菊花丛。\n遥想玉人肠断处，屈遍春葱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"鸦晚又鸡晨。\n最恼离人。\n添花补柳为谁春。\n飞鹊镜中妆态减，窗锁朱尘。\n璧月几回新。\n惯照眉颦。\n青山隐隐水粼粼。\n万水千山经岁别，远似星津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"归思满琴心。\n幽恨难禁。\n月儿楼下海棠阴。\n想见纤纤弦上手，羽咽高沈。\n青鸟寄归音。\n一字千金。\n离鸾别凤谩沈吟。\n花发月圆须寄取，好在春深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何满子 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"玄灞长松繫马，青门高树藏鸦。\n红雨秋千香径软，乐游原上谁家。\n客里心情缭乱，愁看风外杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何满子 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"夜夜遥钟促漏，朝朝急莞清笳。\n行见月圆还月缺，乡关犹隔三巴。\n客里形容憔悴，愁看匣里菱花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何满子 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"欹枕梦回春晚，倚阑人在天涯。\n迢递关山千万里，佳期水渺云赊。\n记得罗巾别泪，愁看带雨梨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何满子 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"韪鴂催成绿雨，鹧鸪啼破红霞。\n马上韶华真似梦，恼人春思交加。\n记得晓妆临镜，愁看映水桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆世耕亭。\n樵斧丁丁惊鹳雀，钓丝袅袅立蜻蜓。\n百曲建长瓴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"来往惯，蓬户不教扃。\n山屐过时穿嫩藓，野航移处破浮萍。\n炬火晚荧荧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆力耕亭。\n径路喜逢樵叟话，蹊田一任牧童经。\n浑不限畦町。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"螺涧底，呜玉漱清泠。\n千里清风来曲几，一方明月挂疏棂。\n欹枕酒初醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆约耕亭。\n曲水流觞穿竹细，奇峰侧岛泛花馨。\n唤作小沧溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其六","author":"杨慎","text":"长夏日，独往亦消停。\n仙酝一壶倾绿醑，蛮笺十样写黄庭。\n落魄尽忘形。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其七","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆阅耕亭。\n流水两地分丽泽，好山四面列围屏。\n修竹绕青青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其八","author":"杨慎","text":"松槛外，鹭渚与凫汀。\n茅屋不愁经夜雨，草堂还喜带春星。\n歌咏满林坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其九","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆是恩波。\n月映涟漪天映水，霞翻菡萏露翻荷。\n风景占偏多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十","author":"杨慎","text":"茅屋小，斜枕碧山阿。\n蕙冷松寒闻夜鹤，藻香萍煖下天鹅。\n不羡懒云窝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十一","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆是毗江。\n夹路青萝藏古寺，半林红叶照清淙。\n烟社枕云杠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十二","author":"杨慎","text":"霜景霁，何处远钟撞。\n扣月渔榔寒轧轧，祈年社鼓夜逢逢。\n幽梦起山窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十三","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆是龙门。\n洞底渔舟藏夜壑，山头佛刹挂朝暾。\n暧暧远人村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十四","author":"杨慎","text":"登顿处，萝磴几回扪。\n檐葡林中消永日，松篁影里荫芳尊。\n归路已黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十五","author":"杨慎","text":"故园好，最忆是中洲。\n宛在中央浑绝俗，登兹四望可销忧。\n丘壑擅风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望江南 其十六","author":"杨慎","text":"凉吹满，六月早知秋。\n仙侣泛花曾共醉，野人刻竹记同游。\n何日问归舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生查子 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"金匮失玄参，无约何时会。\n争道破揪枰，心为佳期碎。\n杨柳困三眠，终日常如醉。\n露泣缠枝花，满眼娇情泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生查子 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"两朵活莲花，一对相思卦。\n裙底耍鸳鸯，巧笔难描画。\n春困步苍苔，背立秋千下。\n心事倩谁传，花落西厢夜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"江水。\n江水。\n昨夜风惊浪起。\n眼看估客归舟。\n肠断征人泪流。\n流泪。\n流泪。\n离恨江沙共碎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"归路。\n归路。\n遥隔铁桥铜柱。\n楼头秋霁无尘。\n陌上愁看去人。\n人去。\n人去。\n心头千山碧树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"转应曲 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"采菊。\n采菊。\n且醉尊前醽醁。\n百分觥棹船空。\n万虑销沈酒中。\n中酒。\n中酒。\n又度客边重九。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其一 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"花亚朵，柳垂丝。\n楼上风和玉漏迟。\n春困苦多无处卖，日长惟与睡相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其二 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"风料峭，月栊明。\n滴破春愁压酒声。\n犹有夸张年少处，醉闻花气睡闻莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其三 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"长寂寞，独徘徊。\n抱病起登江上台。\n万户千门春色闭，谁家桃李乱中开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其四 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"销午梦，减春愁。\n上尽重楼更上楼。\n日暮乡关何处是，寒鸦飞去水悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其五 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"金碧岸，锦春丛。\n红白花开烟雨中。\n今日乱离俱是梦，六街尘起鼓冬冬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣练子 集句 其六 伤乱","author":"杨慎","text":"愁对酒，懒看花。\n病入新年感物华。\n万里寂寥音信断，山楼粉蝶隐悲笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其一 游感通寺赠冰壶","author":"杨慎","text":"病起思乡太剧愁。\n荒城无地可登楼。\n仙人要我感通游。\n绿水似环萦岛屿，白云如带绕林丘。\n凉风先借一分秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其二 游感通寺赠冰壶","author":"杨慎","text":"柳绿槐黄放晓晴。\n天公知我欲山行。\n峰峦相顾亦多情。\n玉树临风无奈爽，冰壶见底有余清。\n长生仙客话无生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西江月 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"酝造一场烦恼，只因些子恩情。\n阳台春梦不曾成。\n枉度雨云朝暝。\n燕子那知我意，莺儿似唤他名。\n消除只有话无生。\n除却心头重省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西江月 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"倚醉深关朱户，娇羞怕捧金觥。\n背人弹泪绕花行，唱尽新词懒听。\n总是为郎调护，当初枉道无情。\n英雄摩勒肯重生。\n赎取佳人薄命。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西江月 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"自有嫩枝柔叶，何须补柳添花。\n低声昵语似雏鸦。\n肠断东桥月下。\n香雾清辉何处，春风今夜谁家。\n五花骢马七香车。\n趁取小乔未嫁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":28511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]